### 1. Enregistrer un utilisateur
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amine",
  "email": "amine@test.com",
  "password": "pass123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### 2. Se connecter pour obtenir le Token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "amine@test.com",
  "password": "pass123"
}

###

### 3. Valider le Token (Copie le résultat du test 2 après le égal)
GET http://localhost:8081/auth/validate?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbWluZUB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc4Nzg1MDY1NCwiZXhwIjoxNzg3ODUyNDU0fQ.jQyb3CPMxLItEGGTBRYlAG44269UwB-_Ynpa1U84wwc


### Créer un Hackathon
POST http://localhost:8080/hackathons
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbWluZUB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc4ODA5MTE1MiwiZXhwIjoxNzg4MDkyOTUyfQ.qWGl0gMeAznVge6EAPsthAg8e7xr_oqVBlHW3nfytEo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "RamadanIA 2024",
  "description": "Hackathon sur l'intelligence artificielle au service du citoyen.",
  "theme": "IA & Social",
  "startDate": "2024-03-10",
  "endDate": "2024-03-12",
  "location": "Rabat",
  "status": "PUBLISHED"
}

### Lister tous les hackathons
GET http://localhost:8082/hackathons

###
