### 1. Créer une équipe (si pas déjà fait)
POST http://localhost:8080/teams
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbWluZUB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc4ODUzMDY4OSwiZXhwIjoxNzg4NTMyNDg5fQ.xbNfYVubxJkZ8WdnTC3Sm9zs_rCZaJ1XAcgtwEWUPTs

{
  "name": "Team AI Builders",
  "hackathonId": 1
}

### 2. Affecter le mentor (ID 2) à l'équipe (ID 1)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/teams/1/assign-mentor/2
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbWluZUB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc4ODUzMDY4OSwiZXhwIjoxNzg4NTMyNDg5fQ.xbNfYVubxJkZ8WdnTC3Sm9zs_rCZaJ1XAcgtwEWUPTs

### 3. Consulter les équipes encadrées par le mentor 2
GET http://localhost:8080/teams/mentor/2
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbWluZUB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc4ODUzMDY4OSwiZXhwIjoxNzg4NTMyNDg5fQ.xbNfYVubxJkZ8WdnTC3Sm9zs_rCZaJ1XAcgtwEWUPTs